# Local development secrets (copy to .dev.vars and fill in real values).
#
# Not read by the Worker — its bindings and wrangler.jsonc vars cover it, and a user's
# credentials arrive by pairing into KV. This is for local tooling only.

# Stremio auth key of a *test* account (it is account-wide, so it is the account).
# web.stremio.com in a private window → DevTools → Application → Local Storage → authKey
STREMIO_AUTH_KEY=
